        {
          "label": "Actual reflected conditional centered residual limit",
          "tex": "S_y=(2x-y)_\\#R_y=Z_y^{-1}e^{-W_y}du,\\quad W_y(u)=V((y+u)/2)+\\|u-y\\|^2/(8\\eta),\\quad\\int f\\,dS_y=0\\Longrightarrow\\varepsilon_nu_n\\to0\\text{ in }L^2(S_y)."
